{"4682840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RETRIEVAL", "steam_appid": 4682840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4801750], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Loop</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a single, endlessly looping house. Every time you walk through the door, the environment shifts. The lighting changes, the atmosphere grows more oppressive, and reality begins to glitch. Pay attention to your surroundings, as each new loop spawns crucial clues in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract the Past</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the shifting rooms are Memory Fragments. Examine these objects closely and read them to extract crucial keywords. These physical fragments appear in chronological order, slowly building the foundation of what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1072 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the Truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your only tool to break the cycle is an old desktop computer sitting in the room. Use the keywords you've extracted to search the terminal's database. Because the system limits you to four results per search, you must carefully read unlocked diaries to deduce new, hidden keywords and dive deeper into the system to trigger the next loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Looping Gameplay:</strong> Experience a single environment that evolves and decays with every puzzle you solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyword Deduction System:</strong> A unique text-based puzzle mechanic where reading comprehension and deductive reasoning unlock the path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong> Reconstruct a deeply psychological horror story by combining linear 3D memory fragments with non-linear 2D diary entries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Interface:</strong> Seamlessly transition between first-person 3D exploration and a fully interactive 2D desktop terminal.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the Loop</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a single, endlessly looping house. Every time you walk through the door, the environment shifts. The lighting changes, the atmosphere grows more oppressive, and reality begins to glitch. Pay attention to your surroundings, as each new loop spawns crucial clues in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/db933c0fc82f4b4a57982b462fa077c2.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract the Past</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the shifting rooms are Memory Fragments. Examine these objects closely and read them to extract crucial keywords. These physical fragments appear in chronological order, slowly building the foundation of what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1072 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/ba36292dea152ac3750c42751d648e5a.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for the Truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.poster.avif?t=1787545549\" width=1066 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.webm?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/extras/a546da3e1548f6cc6588634f970c4c01.mp4?t=1787545549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your only tool to break the cycle is an old desktop computer sitting in the room. Use the keywords you've extracted to search the terminal's database. Because the system limits you to four results per search, you must carefully read unlocked diaries to deduce new, hidden keywords and dive deeper into the system to trigger the next loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Looping Gameplay:</strong> Experience a single environment that evolves and decays with every puzzle you solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyword Deduction System:</strong> A unique text-based puzzle mechanic where reading comprehension and deductive reasoning unlock the path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong> Reconstruct a deeply psychological horror story by combining linear 3D memory fragments with non-linear 2D diary entries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Interface:</strong> Seamlessly transition between first-person 3D exploration and a fully interactive 2D desktop terminal.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "RETRIEVAL is a first-person psychological horror game where you explore a looping house, collect scattered memory fragments, and search extracted keywords in an old computer terminal to uncover a tragic truth.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/09440688b2e6f5c7024cdd2a43976dddbc825588/header.jpg?t=1787545549", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/c2e1027d0a5bce31378669fa83943ac29555def4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787545549", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682840/c2e1027d0a5bce31378669fa83943ac29555def4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787545549", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><stro